<title>UK: First Chicago NBD sets $250 mln 30-year FRN, call.</title>
<headline>First Chicago NBD sets $250 mln 30-year FRN, call.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated callable floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Lehman</p>
<p>Brothers International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FIRST CHICAGO NBD CORP</p>
<p> AMT	  $250 MLN  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY   *2027</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     **	  PAY DATE    =</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  **	  FULL FEES   1.00</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    **</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER TO YIELD 3ML +62-64 BP.</p>
<p>	     *CALL AT PAR AFTER 10 YEARS.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
